sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as CLI / API Consumer
    participant API as src/api.ts (scan / scanWarm)
    participant Cache as CacheStore (L1 + L2)
    participant Router as SparseMoEGateRouter
    participant Native as Rust N-API / NativeBridge
    participant Scorer as Tri-Plane QualityScorer

    Caller->>API: 1. Invoke scan(options)
    API->>Cache: 2. Probe L1/L2 cache by Composite Fingerprint
    Cache-->>API: Hit unchanged files & topology edges
    API->>Router: 3. Compute active analyzers for dirty files (CED MoE)
    Router->>Native: 4. Execute oxc Mode A + ops-mask + ops-graph + ops-clone
    Native-->>API: Emit normalized issues + SemanticGraph edges
    API->>Scorer: 5. Run finalizeReport (Cycle Pass + Ratchet + 10-Pillar Score + CAI)
    Scorer-->>Caller: 6. Return deterministic ScanReport
